{"availability":"available","full":"integry/propr","name":"propr","description":"Open source, self-hosted GitHub orchestration for AI coding agents. Runs Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, OpenCode and Mistral Vibe on your server and ships every change as a reviewed pull request: issue to PR, AI code review, automated fix loops.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":16,"forks":7,"created":"2025-05-23T13:09:47Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:55:48Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://propr.dev","topics":["agent-orchestration","agentic-coding","ai-agents","ai-code-review","ai-coding","antigravity","claude","claude-code","code-review","codex","coding-agent","coding-agents","devtools","github-automation","github-bot","mcp","mistral","opencode","pull-requests","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://demo.propr.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:02:56.298Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:02:56.298Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:02:56.298Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:40.805Z","stars":14,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:42:52.686Z","stars":14,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:02:56.298Z","stars":16,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Every task runs in an isolated workspace and lands as a pull request you refine in GitHub.","Quickstart · Docs · Live demo · Website · Discord · Built with ProPR","From a labeled GitHub issue to a reviewed, merged pull request in 68 seconds."],"features":["Label a GitHub issue and an agent implements it, then opens a PR linked back to the issue. State labels track progress automatically.","Turn an idea into review-sized tasks with acceptance criteria. Refine the plan in chat, then create the GitHub issues.","Comment /review on any PR for severity-grouped findings and a score. Apply them with /fix.","An automated review, repair and re-review loop that runs until the PR reaches the score you set, then hands it bac